     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Le r&#xE9;sultat obtenu en d&#xE9;cembre 2023 gr&#xE2;ce au soutien du gouvernement canadien et d&apos;autres donateurs internationaux comprend la fourniture de nouveaux antiviraux COVID-19, d&apos;installations d&apos;oxyg&#xE8;ne m&#xE9;dical et de mat&#xE9;riel &#xE0; 74 pays.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The result achieved as of December 2023 through the support of the Canadian government and other international donors includes the provision of novel COVID-19 antivirals, medical oxygen facilities, and supplies to 74 countries.</narrative>
